        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Colonial Crest Reed Lever with Egg and Dart Rose Fusion AN-A1 \r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you demand quality and craftmanship make a statement with Fusion. Backed by a lifetme limited warrant. High Quality Custom Solid Brass Lever.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features of Door Lever:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dual Spring Assist- To eliminate Lever Wobble</li>\r\n<li>Auto-adjust- For Easy Installation</li>\r\n<li>Conforms To ANSI Grade 2 Latch Standards</li>\r\n<li>Standard Door Installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold As Complete Sets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: Dummy knobs and levers are bolt-through. Screws actually attach the dummies from the interior side of the door, which makes for a clean exterior visual. This applies to single and double dummies.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
